    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcb50dc1b45ed4fa2547a64b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "星屑は金平糖、お月様は\r\n黄身しぐれ…。晴れの日の夜空は…\r\n和菓子でいっぱい、です…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10faced97c4d30816cea788eeb44357311c0ea4e2850fc237aa7c7a5c22aa6ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
