    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:915f83a03b94346fff73149b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『SAKURA抹茶カプチーノ』――\r\n甘さと苦さが調和した、あの奥深い\r\n味わいは…おすすめ、です…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb0824308048c9fd1e2bb3545c4598243b2592ca3196e4d074a9bfd492453a4b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
